    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16532" root="ركل" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِرْكَلٌ</span></b>  The <i>foot,</i> or <i>leg,</i> [as being the instrument with which the action termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَكْلٌ</span> is performed:] in the copies of the K, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الرَّجُلُ</span> is erroneously put for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الرِّجْلُ</span>: or, accord. to the L, the
<i>foot,</i> or <i>leg, of the rider.</i> (TA.)

